sequenceDiagram
    participant View as EditorA View
    participant Source as EditorA FeatureStore
    participant SourceRunner as EditorA FeatureStore.ExecuteAsync
    participant Mediator as Mediator
    participant Target as EditorB FeatureStore
    participant Reducer as EditorB FeatureStore.Reduce
    participant TargetRunner as EditorB FeatureStore.ExecuteAsync

    View->>Source: 生成业务 Intent
    Source->>Source: 纯 Reduce 与本实例状态提交
    Source->>SourceRunner: 执行已接纳 OperationEffect
    SourceRunner->>Mediator: SendAsync(SaveRequest, editorBPort)
    Mediator->>Target: 定向交付 SaveRequest
    Target->>Target: 契约入口映射 OperationStartIntent
    Note over Mediator,Target: 关闭或收件箱已满可返回拒绝结果
    critical EditorB CommitGate
        Target->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, saveIntent)
        Reducer-->>Target: OperationReduction(RunningSnapshot, [SaveEffect], Accepted)
        Target->>Target: 原子提交 Running 与 Version
    end
    Target->>TargetRunner: 锁外执行 SaveEffect
    TargetRunner->>TargetRunner: await 目标业务 IO
    loop 结果与操作完成分别反馈
        TargetRunner->>Target: 内部 Intent
        critical EditorB CommitGate
            Target->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, feedbackIntent)
            Reducer-->>Target: RuntimeSnapshot(nextState, operations, version)
            Target->>Target: 原子提交统一快照与 Version
        end
        Target-->>TargetRunner: 反馈处理完成
    end
    Target-->>Mediator: Completed 与 SaveResult
    Mediator-->>SourceRunner: SendAsync 的目标处理完成
    SourceRunner->>Source: 请求结果转换为源实例内部 Intent
    Source->>Source: 纯 Reduce 与本实例状态提交
    Note over Source,Target: 各实例独立 State / Operation / Gate；无跨实例原子提交
    Note over SourceRunner,Target: 接纳后取消源等待，不证明目标执行停止

    opt 只需要收件箱接纳结果
        SourceRunner->>Mediator: Post(明确契约消息, editorBPort)
        Mediator->>Target: 定向交付消息
        Target->>Target: 映射 Intent 并进入本实例收件箱
        Target-->>Mediator: Accepted
        Mediator-->>SourceRunner: 接纳结果
        Note over Target,Reducer: 后续按当前状态验证与处理；接纳不代表业务完成
    end
